th processes"},{"t":141.4,"txt":"then you need to have two cylinders"},{"t":143,"txt":"which adds some additional cost the"},{"t":144.3,"txt":"second is that the tig welding"},{"t":145.5,"txt":"functionality on most of them is pretty"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"limited compared to a dedicated tig"},{"t":150.1,"txt":"welder so make sure you know what you're"},{"t":151.5,"txt":"getting and if your main process is tig"},{"t":154.4,"txt":"then your money might be better spent on"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"a dedicated machine rather than a"},{"t":157.3,"txt":"multi-process machine before we continue"},{"t":159.5,"txt":"our list let me introduce you to my new"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"welding and fabrication courses that are"},{"t":163.2,"txt":"already helping a lot of people to learn"},{"t":166,"txt":"the process of welding with a lot less"},{"t":169,"txt":"time and frustration it's an affordable"},{"t":171.8,"txt":"way to learn in your garage in small"},{"t":174.5,"txt":"manageable steps just like i would teach"},{"t":176.5,"txt":"you if we were working together in"},{"t":177.9,"txt":"person"},{"t":179,"txt":"now let's continue our list by looking"},{"t":180.7,"txt":"at some essential safety gear that"},{"t":182.3,"txt":"you're going to need because no project"},{"t":183.8,"txt":"is worth getting hurt over you'll need a"},{"t":185.4,"txt":"welding hood or welding helmet i'd"},{"t":187.1,"txt":"recommend an auto darkening unit and"},{"t":189.5,"txt":"they're really nice because a lot of"},{"t":191,"txt":"them have a mode where you can use them"},{"t":193,"txt":"as a full face shield for grinding"},{"t":194.6,"txt":"you'll need gloves appropriate for the"},{"t":196.2,"txt":"process that you're running and a"},{"t":198,"txt":"welding jacket may not be essential but"},{"t":200.1,"txt":"i recommend wearing one"},{"t":202,"txt":"safety glasses and ear plugs for cutting"},{"t":204.2,"txt":"are must and depending on your process"},{"t":206,"txt":"in ventilation you might need a"},{"t":207.3,"txt":"